<%doc>

=head1 NAME

/util/app_layout.mas - the Analysis Pipeline / Decision Meeting look for any tool page

=head1 DESCRIPTION

Loads static/css/breedbase_app.css (green hero banner, numbered stepper, cards,
stat tiles, option cards, tabs, pills and the decision colour code). Wrap the
page in C<< <div class="bb-app"> >>.

=head1 EXAMPLE

  <& /util/app_layout.mas &>
  <div class="bb-app">
    <&| /util/app_hero.mas, title => 'My tool', icon => 'glyphicon-leaf',
        text => 'One sentence on what the tool does.' &>
      <a class="btn btn-default btn-lg" href="/somewhere">A button</a>
    </&>
    <& /util/app_stepper.mas, id => 'my_steps', steps => ['Data', 'Model', 'Results'], active => 0 &>
    <div class="bb-card">
      <div class="bb-card-head"><h3>1. Data</h3></div>
      <p class="bb-help">Help text.</p>
      <div class="bb-section"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-list"></span> A section</div>
      <div class="bb-stats"><div class="bb-stat"><div class="v">12</div><div class="l">trials</div></div></div>
      <div class="bb-options">
        <label class="bb-option on"><input type="radio" name="x" checked>
          <span class="bb-option-title">Option A</span><span class="bb-option-text">What it does.</span></label>
      </div>
      <span class="bb-dec bb-dec-advance">Advance</span> <span class="bb-dec bb-dec-jump">Jump</span>
      <span class="bb-dec bb-dec-hold">Hold</span> <span class="bb-dec bb-dec-drop">Drop</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bb-nav"><button class="btn btn-default">Back</button><button class="btn btn-primary">Next</button></div>
  </div>

Other classes: bb-choices/bb-choice (big choice buttons), bb-tabs/bb-tab,
bb-segs/bb-seg, bb-pill (-open -ok -warn -bad), bb-chip, bb-stage (-new),
bb-empty-card, bb-side (sticky sidebar), bb-table-wrap/bb-table,
bb-row-<decision>, bb-help, bb-muted, bb-ok, bb-spin.
Colours are CSS variables on .bb-app (--bb-accent, --bb-advance, ...), so a
page can override them.

=cut

</%doc>
<& /util/import_css.mas, paths => ['breedbase_app.css'] &>
